<Slide style={{ padding: 0, background: '#FFFFFF', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '100%', height: 76, background: '#0E3F8C', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 16 }}>
            <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 34, background: '#FFC107' }} />
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 32, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>Softmax 与交叉熵损失</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8FC0F0' }}>05 损失函数与优化策略</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 604, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, paddingTop: 20, paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, paddingBottom: 20 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 470, gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 12, background: '#E8EFF8', borderRadius: 8, paddingLeft: 16, paddingTop: 9, paddingBottom: 9 }}>
                <FAIcon name='info-circle' style={{ fill: '#1E4FA8', width: 24, height: 24 }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>同一个样本，训练前后损失差多少？</Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FDECEC', border: '1px solid #F5C6C4', borderRadius: 10, padding: 18, gap: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#B03430' }}>训练初期：把恶性判成良性</Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 92, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#D9534F', lineHeight: 1 }}>1.94</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#B03430' }}>nats</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                    模型只给真实的"恶性"类分配了 14.4% 的概率，损失很高，反向传播会产生很大的梯度把它拉回来。
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#E8EFF8', border: '1px solid #C7D8F2', borderRadius: 10, padding: 18, gap: 4 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 19, color: '#0E3F8C' }}>训练收敛：给出正确答案</Text>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'baseline', gap: 10 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 92, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E4FA8', lineHeight: 1 }}>0.33</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#0E3F8C' }}>nats</Text>
                </Box>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#4A5568', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                    给真实类别 72% 的概率时损失降到 0.33。本项目 ResNet-50 在测试集上的平均损失正好是 0.34——说明它对新样本的自信程度与训练集相当。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ flex: 1, gap: 12 }}>
            <Box style={{ background: '#F7F9FC', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 10, padding: 14, gap: 8 }}>
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4A5568' }}>① Softmax 把 logits 压成概率分布</Text>
                    <Math latex='p_k=\frac{e^{z_k}}{\sum_{j=1}^{K}e^{z_j}}' width={230} color='#0E3F8C' />
                </Box>
                <Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#D6DCE5' }} />
                <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#4A5568' }}>② 交叉熵只惩罚真实类别那一项</Text>
                    <Math latex='L=-\sum_{k=1}^{K}y_k\log p_k=-\log p_{y}' width={250} color='#D9534F' />
                </Box>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', border: '1px solid #D6DCE5', borderRadius: 10, padding: 12, gap: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#0E3F8C' }}>算一遍：logits = [2.10, 0.40, −0.30]，真实标签 = 恶性</Text>
                <Table
                    style={{ width: '100%', height: 176 }}
                    defaultTextStyle={{ fontSize: 16, textAlign: 'center', color: '#1A2230' }}
                    defaultCellStyle={{
                        border: {
                            left: { width: 1, color: '#D6DCE5' }, right: { width: 1, color: '#D6DCE5' },
                            top: { width: 1, color: '#D6DCE5' }, bottom: { width: 1, color: '#D6DCE5' },
                        },
                    }}
                    cells={[
                        [
                            { text: '类别', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#0E3F8C' } } },
                            { text: 'logit z', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#0E3F8C' } } },
                            { text: 'softmax p', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#0E3F8C' } } },
                            { text: 'one-hot y', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#0E3F8C' } } },
                            { text: '−y·log p', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#FFFFFF' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#0E3F8C' } } },
                        ],
                        [
                            '良性 benign', '2.10', '0.785', '0', '0',
                        ],
                        [
                            { text: '恶性 malignant', textStyle: { bold: true }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#FDECEC' } } },
                            { text: '0.40', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#FDECEC' } } },
                            { text: '0.144', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#FDECEC' } } },
                            { text: '1', cellStyle: { background: { color: '#FDECEC' } } },
                            { text: '1.94', textStyle: { bold: true, color: '#D9534F' }, cellStyle: { background: { color: '#FDECEC' } } },
                        ],
                        [
                            '正常 normal', '−0.30', '0.071', '0', '0',
                        ],
                    ]}
                />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#8B97A8' }}>
                    三个 −y·log p 相加 = 1.94，就是这一个样本的交叉熵损失
                </Text>
            </Box>

            <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#FFF8E1', borderLeft: '5px solid #FFC107', borderRadius: 8, padding: 14, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A2230', lineHeight: 1.55 }}>
                    <span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>判断：</span>交叉熵只在乎"真实类别的概率是否足够高"，其余两类的概率分配不影响损失值。这带来一个副作用——模型容易被鼓励过度自信，所以下一步要引入标签平滑与类别权重。
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingLeft: 40, paddingRight: 40, borderTop: '1px solid #E5E7EB' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#8B97A8' }}>BUSI 乳腺超声图像分类 · 乳腺癌智能诊断</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#1E4FA8' }}>24 / 38</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
